                <pb facs="0035" n="10" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v08/pg10"/>

                <head>5. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On February 7 the President approved Supplement I to NSC 5803 entitled “Statement
                    of Policy on U.S. Policy on Berlin.” The text is virtually identical to that in
                    Supplement I to NSC 5727, December 13, 1957, printed in <ref
                        target="frus:frus1955-57v26/pg_521"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1955–1957, volume XXVI, pages 521</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1955-57v26/pg_525">525</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
